      "content": "those sound like good starting points. i really want to push the idea that the current way things are set up—with all the huge corporations and billionaire wealth—is actually morally wrong and outdated, not just \"inefficient.\" can you help me write a section for the manifesto that argues why the old system of private accumulation is fundamentally incompatible with a just future? i want it to sound like this shift is an inevitable moral necessity.",
